emary if you'd like. I usually double the quantity when cooking with fresh instead of dried so in this case I'd use 4 finely minced cloves of garlic and 4 very finely minced tablespoons of rosemary.","time":1618837702061,"userId":"9acc1803bb49d8e1f565ad16cecad0ab","userPic":"$profile:7ab789456869965485e7389825cfb8d0.jpg","userType":"email"}},"time":1618792647295,"userId":"9a17248f7ad576b1ba24efda8d08ccea","userType":"email"},"-Ml14UheEm_MW1JOCqAE":{"author":"Patricia Swanson","notifications":true,"page":"http:\/\/www.theglasspantry.com\/single-post\/2018\/02\/20\/Cranberry-Sourdough-Bread","pageTitle":"Cranberry Sourdough Bread","path":"\/single-post\/2018\/02\/20\/Cranberry-Sourdough-Bread","rating":4,"text":"First time making this recipe. I needed a sourdough loaf\/boule that would raise and bake in one afternoon. This really hit the mark. I will have to ask the recipient of this bread for an evaluation of the taste. I loved how easy the dough mixed and handled.👍","thread":{"-Ml1AoEZIhyn4y2MCbG1":{"author":"Melisa","page":"http:\/\/www.theglasspantry.com\/single-post\/2018\/02\/20\/Cranberry-Sourdough-Bread","text":"Thank you so much Patricia!","time":1633197966997,"userId":"9acc1803bb49d8e1f565ad16cecad0ab","userPic":"$profile:7ab789456869965485e7389825cfb8d0.jpg","userType":"email"}},"time":1633196309710,"userId":"cefc7465ecef1a4daf631774ed0020f6","userType":"email"},"-MxHl4K_qKDyMqaMMVI6":{"author":"Danielle","notifications":true,"page":"http:\/\/www.theglasspantry.com\/single-post\/2017\/11\/26\/Soft-Sourdough-Dinner-rolls","pageTitle":"Soft Sourdough Dinner Rolls","path":"\/single-post\/2017\/11\/26\/Soft-Sourdough-Dinner-rolls","text":"These are amazing! My fav sourdough roll so far.❤\n\n","time":1646361073853,"userId":"b8fd3453910ac0b94b78a79dce707c3d","userType":"email","website":"www.LooksEverlasting.com"},"-N8ArLYTnd_1IwU94lRC":{"author":"Alicia Hursley","notifications":true,"page":"http:\/\/www.theglasspantry.com\/single-post\/episode-19-cb-radio-instal